# internal/httpui/dist is populated by `task dashboard:build-embed`
# (dashboard/dist copied here for go:embed, P2a-UI-001). Only the
# compile-time placeholder marker is tracked, so go:embed always has
# something to embed on a fresh checkout that hasn't run the dashboard
# build yet; httpui.New() fails closed if that's all it finds.
!internal/httpui/dist/
internal/httpui/dist/*
!internal/httpui/dist/.buildmarker
.kilo/
